# Atlas civic workstations — isolated artwork

Four separately generated portrait backgrounds match the expansion module’s exact new location IDs and sceneBriefs. Large empty tables reserve the playable center; ordinary architecture and background shelving are scenery, not game inventory. No private screenshots were inputs or outputs.

Generated with built-in image_gen. Actual pixels inspected. The law/consent images received targeted built-in edits to remove identifiable skyline landmarks; originals remain in the generation workspace and reasons/prompts are in art-manifest.json. WebP conversion changes encoding only, preserving source geometry.

These are illustrative comparative settings, not precise historical reconstructions or evidence that the authors met. Native/browser/iOS layout and readability are not tested. Artwork readiness does not imply review approval or authorize promoting the Atlas expansion. No live or previously sealed source was changed.
